  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arms Trade Treaty Voluntary Trust Fund Contribution 2022-23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Arms Trade Treaty Voluntary Trust Fund assists states to implement the Arms Trade Treaty including with respect to legal or legislative assistance, institutional capacity building and technical assistance. The Voluntary Trust Fund is administered by the Arms Trade Treaty Secretariat with support from the Voluntary Trust Fund Selection Committee consisting of States Parties appointed by the Conferences of States Parties - Australia is a member of this Selection Committee.</narrative>
  </description>
